                <pb facs="0593" n="497" xml:id="pg497"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.60 p 31/23: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Latvia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Coleman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-09-15T15:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                                1925—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 15—10:47
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>81. Your 41, August 11, 3 p.m. Until general elections take place October 4th and
                    new Government comes in, it is impossible to make any progress in negotiations.
                    Full particulars go forward in pouch this week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Coleman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
